Repository: this .ninfer repackaging of ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-GSQ-RCO-GGUF
for the NInfer engine. Four tiers are published, all from the source's -mtp
packages: IQ2_XS (swift15_iq2xs_mtp.ninfer), IQ2_S (swift15_iq2s_mtp.ninfer),
IQ3_XXS (swift15_iq3xxs_mtp.ninfer) and IQ3_S (swift15_iq3s_mtp.ninfer).

Converter provenance:

  * The conversion was performed with the `qwen3_8_27b_gguf` recipe from
    github.com/Ryan-gsq/ninfer-16g-5070ti-5080-5090-qwen3.8-27b-gsq-rco
    (Apache-2.0; a fork of iamwavecut/ninfer-all, originating from Neroued/ninfer).
    Its tools/convert pipeline produced every object in this artifact.

Changes relative to the weight source (ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-GSQ-RCO-GGUF):

  * The GGUF tensor payloads were imported into the NInfer container
    (`gguf_blocks_v1` layout, encodings preserved: gguf_iq2_s / gguf_iq3_s /
    gguf_iq3_xxs / gguf_iq2_xs / gguf_iq1_m / gguf_iq1_s / gguf_q2_k / gguf_q4_k /
    gguf_q6_k / gguf_iq4_xs). Text-tower quantized blocks were **not**
    dequantized or requantized.
  * Vision tensors were re-encoded groupwise (q4_g64_fp16 / q5_g64_fp16 /
    q8_g32_fp16) from the BF16 mmproj GGUF; norms and biases cast to bf16/fp32.
  * The MTP-head packages (Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-GSQ-RCO-IQ2_XS-mtp.gguf,
    -IQ2_S-mtp.gguf, -IQ3_XXS-mtp.gguf and -IQ3_S-mtp.gguf) were merged into
    their respective containers.
  * Tokenizer, chat template, generation config, vision preprocessor configs
    were carried over verbatim as container resources.
  * A proposal head (frequency shortlist, 131072 entries) was gathered from the
    output head by the converter, as its recipe does.
  * Full per-object provenance: the four swift15_*.ninfer.conversion.json
    files in this repo.

No model behaviour was modified: this is a format conversion, not a fine-tune.